# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
# SECURITY: Ensure all local environment files are gitignored.
# .env holds project-level defaults; .env.local and variants hold real secrets.
# Even though *.local covers these, explicit entries prevent accidental commits
# if the glob is ever narrowed or removed.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development.local
.env.production.local
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*serviceAccount*.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
